    <bpmn:process id="W_W1726" name="W1726. Capital Increase &amp; Stock Issuance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Board decision to increase authorized capital stock (for business expansion, debt-to-equity conversion, or new investor)
Frequency: Rare — every 2–5 years depending on growth needs
Volume: Low volume but legally and financially significant
Owner: Corporate Secretary
Participants: Corporate Secretary, CFO, Legal Counsel, Board, Stockholders, SEC
Source: workflow W1726 — Capital Increase &amp; Stock Issuance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1726_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1726_Lane1" name="Board">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1726_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1726_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1726_Lane2" name="Stockholders">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1726_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1726_Lane3" name="Corporate Secretary">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1726_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1726_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1726_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1726_End11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1726_Start5" name="Board decision to increase authorized capital stock (for business expansion…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1726_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1726_Task6" name="Board approves increase in authorized capital stock: (a) current authorized…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Board approves increase in authorized capital stock: (a) current authorized capital and utilization, (b) proposed new authorized capital, (c) number of new shares and par value, (d) purpose of increase (store expansion, debt repayment, new entity capitalization), (e) pre-emptive rights of existing stockholders
Responsible (R): Board
Accountable (A): Board Chair
Duration: At board meeting</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1726_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1726_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1726_Task7" name="Stockholder approval: (a) 2/3 vote of outstanding shares required per Revised…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Stockholder approval: (a) 2/3 vote of outstanding shares required per Revised Corporation Code, (b) stockholders&#x27; meeting called or written assent obtained, (c) stockholders may subscribe to new shares in proportion to existing holdings (pre-emptive right)
Responsible (R): Stockholders
Accountable (A): Board Chair
Duration: 2–4 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1726_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1726_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1726_Task8" name="SEC filing: (a) amended articles of incorporation filed with SEC, (b) includes…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: SEC filing: (a) amended articles of incorporation filed with SEC, (b) includes board resolution, stockholder resolution, and capital increase details, (c) SEC approval obtained (typically 2–4 weeks), (d) filing fees paid
Responsible (R): Corporate Secretary
Accountable (A): Legal Counsel
Duration: 4–6 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1726_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1726_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1726_Task9" name="Stock issuance: (a) new shares issued to subscribing stockholders, (b) stock…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Stock issuance: (a) new shares issued to subscribing stockholders, (b) stock certificates issued per W1724 process, (c) stock ledger updated, (d) payment received from stockholders (cash or property contribution), (e) GL updated: debit cash/receivable, credit issued capital stock and additional paid-in capital
Responsible (R): Corporate Secretary / CFO
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 1–2 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1726_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1726_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1726_Task10" name="Post-issuance: Corporate Secretary updates SEC GIS; CFO includes capital change…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Post-issuance: Corporate Secretary updates SEC GIS; CFO includes capital change in next financial statement; new capital structure reflected in consolidated equity reporting
Responsible (R): Corporate Secretary / CFO
Accountable (A): —
Duration: At next reporting</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1726_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1726_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1726_End11" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1726_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1726_Annotation12">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-350 (ensure controlled execution — Shareholder &amp; Equity Management (PA-36.2).) | - operational: Corporate Secretary review and approval gate
Owner: Corporate Secretary</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
