    <bpmn:process id="W_W1727" name="W1727. Officer &amp; Director Appointment &amp; Changes" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Board decision, resignation, retirement, or removal of officer or director
Frequency: ~5–10 changes/year across 5 entities
Volume: Low volume but legally significant
Owner: Corporate Secretary
Participants: Corporate Secretary, Board Chair, CEO, affected individual, Legal Counsel
Source: workflow W1727 — Officer &amp; Director Appointment &amp; Changes</bpmn:documentation>
