    <bpmn:process id="W_W1728" name="W1728. Corporate Entity Registration &amp; Amendment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New entity creation (e.g., new subsidiary), amendment to existing entity (name change, address change, purpose change), or entity dissolution
Frequency: Rare — every 1–3 years
Volume: Very low — 5 entities currently; new entity creation is exceptional
Owner: Corporate Secretary
Participants: Corporate Secretary, Legal Counsel, CFO, Board, SEC
Source: workflow W1728 — Corporate Entity Registration &amp; Amendment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1728_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1728_Lane1" name="Legal Counsel">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1728_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1728_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1728_Lane2" name="Corporate Secretary">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1728_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1728_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1728_Lane3" name="CFO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1728_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1728_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1728_Start5" name="New entity creation (e.g., new subsidiary), amendment to existing entity (name change…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1728_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1728_Task6" name="For new entity creation: (a) Board approves creation of new subsidiary (e.g…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: For new entity creation: (a) Board approves creation of new subsidiary (e.g., if BuildRight expands into a new business line), (b) Legal Counsel drafts articles of incorporation and by-laws, (c) identifies incorporators (minimum 2 per Revised Corporation Code, reduced from previous 5), (d) determines principal office, corporate purpose, authorized capital, term of existence
Responsible (R): Legal Counsel / Corporate Secretary
Accountable (A): Board
Duration: 2–3 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1728_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1728_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1728_Task7" name="SEC registration: (a) file articles of incorporation with SEC, (b) pay filing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: SEC registration: (a) file articles of incorporation with SEC, (b) pay filing fees, (c) SEC issues certificate of incorporation, (d) obtain tax identification number (TIN) from BIR, (e) register with local LGU for business permit, (f) register with SSS, PhilHealth, Pag-IBIG as employer (if entity will have employees)
Responsible (R): Corporate Secretary / Legal Counsel
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: 4–8 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1728_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1728_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1728_Task8" name="For amendments: (a) board and stockholder approval per Revised Corporation…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: For amendments: (a) board and stockholder approval per Revised Corporation Code, (b) file amended articles with SEC, (c) update BIR, LGU, bank records, (d) update corporate records per W1719
Responsible (R): Corporate Secretary
Accountable (A): Legal Counsel
Duration: 4–6 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1728_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1728_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1728_Task9" name="Post-registration: CFO opens bank accounts for new entity; IT configures ERP…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Post-registration: CFO opens bank accounts for new entity; IT configures ERP entity; Accounting Manager establishes GL and COA for new entity; intercompany relationships documented
Responsible (R): CFO / IT / Accounting Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 1–2 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1728_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1728_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1728_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1728_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
